      "name": "medication_class_initiated",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.72,
      "source_groundedness": 0.85,
      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Medication class started is a genuine axis correlating with departments. Values are grounded (doxycycline->antibiotic, topical adapalene present but only antibiotic captured is a minor read). Dominant none_initiated is common but derivable."
