  "analytical_usefulness": 0.78,
  "source_groundedness": 0.86,
  "rationale": "Most added columns provide genuinely useful, distinct axes (body system, chief complaint, workup type, medication class) that directly help map visit reasons to departments, and are well grounded in the reason_for_visit text. Some overlap exists among visit_type, symptom_onset_pattern, and clinical_severity, and clinical_severity in particular is a weaker, partly redundant and less directly grounded inference. No clear hallucinations observed; silent-row handling (not_present/none_ordered/none_initiated) is appropriate."
